wgestures (2.1.4ubuntu1) noble; urgency=high

  * Launch CrossGestures from the installer completion page with the elevated
    Setup token, avoiding Windows CreateProcess error 740.
  * Use native 64-bit Program Files and registry views on x64 Windows while
    retaining x86 compatibility and the AnyCPU application build.
  * Set only the Windows top-right trigger corner to Win+Tab by default; leave
    every other trigger corner and rub edge unassigned.

 -- CrossGestures Contributors <Ying@YingDev.com>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:30:00 +0800

wgestures (2.1.3ubuntu1) noble; urgency=high

  * Ship exactly four first-install and reset-default gestures on Windows and
    Linux: copy, paste, Enter and toggle always-on-top.
  * Export only the gestures visible in the selected Windows gesture list.
  * Lock Windows commands to the gesture-start target and pace injected keys
    for reliable copy and paste in Codex, Chromium and WebView2 applications.
  * Adapt copy and paste for Windows Terminal and legacy Console Host.
  * Install the public Windows build elevated and autostart it with a
    highest-privilege scheduled task so protected applications remain global.

 -- CrossGestures Contributors <Ying@YingDev.com>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 20:30:00 +0800

