wgestures (2.1.2ubuntu7) noble; urgency=medium

  * Rename the cross-platform product to CrossGestures while retaining the
    wgestures Linux package, command, configuration path and extension UUID.
  * Restore the Windows Win32 application as a maintained build target for
    Windows 7 SP1, 8.1, 10 and 11 alongside the existing Linux backends.
  * Make low-level keyboard hooks pointer-size safe and remove build-time COM
    type-library dependencies for reliable x64 and Windows 11 builds.
  * Add a per-user EXE installer, Windows CI and dual-platform release assets.
  * Remove the original private-certificate requirement and update
    Newtonsoft.Json to the supported 13.0.3 release.

 -- CrossGestures Contributors <Ying@YingDev.com>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800

wgestures (2.1.2ubuntu6) noble; urgency=high

